              highlighted: ["AB","BC","AC"] },
            { text: "Draw {BA} through to the point {D}, and make {DA} equal to {CA}.",
              visible: ["ABC","AD","D"],
              highlighted: ["AD","AC"],
              transition: {
                  animations: [
                      { elem: "AD", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeExtend },
                      { elem: "D",  name: geomlib.A.Point.appear }
                  ]
              },
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.Post.2" }, { ref: "I.3" }] },
            { text: "Join {DC}.",
              visible: ["ABC","AD","D","CD","ACD"],
              transition: {
                  animations: [
                      { elem: "CD",  name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect }
                  ]
              },
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.Post.1" }] },
            { text: "Since {DA} equals {AC}, therefore the angle {ADC} also equals the angle {ACD|DCA}. Therefore the angle {BCD} is greater than the angle {ADC}.",
              visible: ["ABC","AD","D","CD","ACD","ADC","DCA","BCD"],
              highlighted: ["AD","AC","ADC","DCA","BCD"],
              transition: {
                  mode: "parallel",
                  animations: [
                      { elem: "ADC", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                      { elem: "DCA", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep },
                      { elem: "BCD", name: geomlib.A.Sector.sweep }
                  ]
              },
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.5" }, { ref: "C.N.5" }] },
            { text: "Since {DCB} is a triangle having the angle {BCD} greater than the angle {BDC}, and the side opposite the greater angle is greater, therefore {DB} is greater than {BC}.",
              visible: ["ABC","AD","D","CD","ACD","ADC","BCD","DCB"],
              highlighted: ["BCD","BDC","DB","BC"],
              transition: {
                  animations: [
                      { elem: "DCB", name: geomlib.A.Polygon.outline }
                  ]
              },
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.19" }] },
            { text: "But {DA} equals {AC}, therefore the sum of {BA} and {AC} is greater than {BC}.",
              visible: ["ABC","AD","D","CD","ACD"],
              highlighted: ["AD","AC","AB","BC"] },
            { text: "Similarly we can prove that the sum of {AB} and {BC} is also greater than {CA}, and the sum of {BC} and {CA} is greater than {AB}.",
